    <string name="about_release_plan_title">Release Signing &amp; Update Plan</string>
    <string name="about_release_plan_body">• App Signing: Android App Bundle (AAB) signed via CI environment Keystore variables (outside VCS) and Google Play App Signing; dependencies metadata stripped from APK.\n• Runtime &amp; Agent Updates: Managed via SHA-256 and ABI-verified HTTPS manifest channels independently of APK releases.\n• Atomic Rollback: Runtime upgrades stage cleanly before swap; repair tools preserve confined workspaces, Keystore vaults, and GitHub sessions.</string>
    <string name="about_licenses_title">Open-Source &amp; Runtime License Notices</string>
    <string name="about_licenses_intro">Core third-party libraries and optional runtime packages shipped or fetched by AGT Code:</string>
    <string name="about_license_agt">• AGT Code App Shell — Clean-room Android Kotlin &amp; Jetpack Compose architecture</string>
    <string name="about_license_androidx">• AndroidX, Jetpack Compose, Navigation, Room, DataStore &amp; Security Crypto — Apache-2.0</string>
    <string name="about_license_kotlin">• Kotlin Standard Library, Coroutines &amp; Serialization — Apache-2.0</string>
    <string name="about_license_networking">• OkHttp, Retrofit, Moshi &amp; Coil — Apache-2.0</string>
    <string name="about_license_proot">• PRoot (optional M4 Linux rootfs compatibility bundle) — GPL-2.0</string>
    <string name="about_license_talloc">• Talloc (optional M4 Linux rootfs dependency) — LGPL-3.0-or-later</string>
    <string name="about_license_opencode">• OpenCode Agent Runtime &amp; JH GetWay Pro — Executed as external CLI/HTTP integrations without bundled source copyleft leakage</string>
    <string name="about_license_fonts">• Inter &amp; JetBrains Mono Fonts — SIL Open Font License (OFL-1.1)</string>
    <string name="about_license_antigem">• Clean-Room Compliance Notice — Zero GPL-3.0 code copied from AntiGem; all Android orchestration, security vaults, and UI are authored independently.</string>

